 "description": "Full company context for one US symbol in a single call: profile (name, exchange, industry, country, market cap, shares outstanding, IPO date, website, logo), headline fundamentals (P/E, EPS, 52-week range, beta, dividend yield, margins, growth), and sector peers. Combines three endpoints so \"tell me about Apple\" needs one tool call, not three. Resolve a company name with finnhub_search_symbols first. International symbols are not on the free tier.",
